# A smoke run: a chat opened from Home, words typed and sent, the message's row in the list (`sent row in the list KEY`,
# said by the app as the row is laid out, the frame it is sent: the row by its key, not words found on screen), the station's answer to the send (its seq: it has the message, not only the outbox), and the station has it
# once (the check). What the screen does as it goes (the field given up at once, the rows above the words not moved
# across) is the Tester's: sfreplay's 03-send-text. (The test agent answers words without `post:` in its output, not in
# the chat: each message here is followed by 本轮 agent 未在对话中回复, as it should be.)
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
shot 1-chat
tap 发消息
type 第一条来自 mbui 的消息 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
said sent row in the list
answered chat.send
shot 2-sent
